{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_171_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_171","textTraditional":"一、二十有二年，春王正月，公至自會。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_171_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_171","textTraditional":"二、夏四月。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_171_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_171","textTraditional":"三、秋七月辛酉，叔老卒。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_171_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_171","textTraditional":"四、冬，公會晉侯、齊侯、宋公、衞侯、鄭伯、曹伯、莒子、邾婁子、滕子、薛伯、〈木巳〉伯、小邾婁子于沙隨。公至自會。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_171_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_171","textTraditional":"五、楚殺其大夫公子追舒。","sentenceOrder":5}],"overrides":{}}